erty states that Va,beR,a× bE Rie. Theproduct of two realnumbers is alsoa", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[5, 437], [540, 447], [540, 466], [5, 457]]}, {"text": "real number.", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[5, 460], [81, 460], [81, 477], [5, 477]]}, {"text": "For Example:", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[5, 478], [81, 481], [81, 499], [5, 496]]}, {"text": "3×4=12ER", "conf": 0.827, "box": [[5, 499], [101, 501], [100, 518], [4, 515]]}, {"text": "b)CommutativePropertyofMultiplication", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[5, 551], [267, 559], [267, 577], [4, 569]]}, {"text": "This property states thatVa,b R,a x b =b×a ie. If we multiply two real numbers in any", "conf": 0.85, "box": [[5, 571], [533, 588], [533, 608], [5, 591]]}, {"text": "order, the product will always be the same.", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[5, 592], [253, 601], [252, 620], [4, 611]]}, {"text": "For Example:", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[6, 613], [81, 617], [81, 634], [5, 631]]}, {"text": "*\"*", "conf": 0.567, "box": [[7, 647], [100, 649], [99, 669], [7, 667]]}, {"text": "5×8=8×5", "conf": 0.74, "box": [[5, 673], [106, 676], [106, 696], [4, 693]]}, {"text": "4.5 × 3.9 = 3.9 × 4.5", "conf": 0.825, "box": [[5, 698], [120, 702], [119, 719], [4, 715]]}, {"text": "26", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[253, 739], [279, 739], [279, 761], [253, 761]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.812, "box": [[423, 738], [524, 742], [523, 759], [422, 754]]}]}